{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765410,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Business Plan","festival_id":521073,"organization_id":2084904,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-15T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/business-plan-commquest26-commercium-the-commerce-society-pgdav-college-m-university-of-delhi-1765410","region":"offline","details":"<p>Got the next big idea? Step into the world of innovation with the Business Plan!<\/p>\n<p>Where creativity meets strategy, innovation meets execution, and entrepreneurial ideas take centre stage.<\/p>\n<p>The Business Plan provides students with a platform to transform their ideas into compelling business models, showcase their entrepreneurial skills, and demonstrate their ability to think innovatively and strategically. Present your vision before a panel of judges, defend your approach, and prove that your idea has what it takes to stand out.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rounds<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Preliminary Round | Online<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants will submit their business plans in the prescribed PPT format.<\/li>\n<li>The preliminary round will be conducted online, 5 days before the main event.<\/li>\n<li>Submissions will be evaluated to shortlist teams for the final offline round.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &ndash; Final Round | Offline<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Shortlisted teams will present their business plans before a panel of judges.<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Each team will get 7&ndash;10 minutes to pitch their idea.<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">This will be followed by a 5-minute Q&amp;A round with the judges.<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Shortlisted teams will be required to submit a 7-slide presentation, excluding the cover and thank-you slides.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to undergraduate students across disciplines.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must consist of 2&ndash;5 members.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Judging Criteria<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pitching<\/li>\n<li>Innovation &amp; Uniqueness<\/li>\n<li>Business Model<\/li>\n<li>Bonus Marks: Effective and convincing responses to the judges' questions can earn bonus marks.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>The Challenge<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Think beyond the conventional. Build a business plan that is innovative, viable, and impactful. Pitch it with conviction, defend it under scrutiny, and turn your idea into a vision worth believing in.<\/p>\n<p>Because great businesses don't begin with a product &mdash; they begin with a great idea.<br \/><br \/><strong>In case of any doubt, kindly contact below<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Dwij Trivedi - 9763989161<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Poorvi Khandelwal - 9461193025<\/strong><\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33504104,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T20:35:10+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T14:57:22+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"case_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"MdRnPip","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":3,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-03 20:39:11","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linke